- **ReDoc**: [/redoc](/redoc)
- **OpenAPI Schema**: [/openapi.json](/openapi.json)
- **Metrics**: [/metrics](/metrics) - Performance metrics
    """,
    version="2.0.0",
    docs_url="/docs",
    redoc_url="/redoc",
    root_path="/api",
    lifespan=lifespan
)

